    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d317">

                <pb facs="0822" n="700" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg700"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. de Claparède</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-11-26"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 26,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I received yesterday at my residence, with
                    the sincerest concern and distress, the melancholy announcement of the serious
                    amputation to which President Hertenstein had been subjected.</p>
                <p>The President of the United States instructs me to convey an expression of his
                    sympathy, and his hopes that President Hertenstein is rapidly recuperating from
                    the operation, which he trusts may restore him to his usual health.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">T. F. Bayard.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
